---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';

const statements = [
  { text: 'Jesus is the Lord.', reference: 'Philippians 2:11' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the King.', reference: 'Revelation 19:16' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Way.', reference: 'John 14:6' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Truth.', reference: 'John 14:6' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Rock.', reference: '1 Corinthians 10:4' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Healer.', reference: 'Matthew 8:16–17' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Redeemer.', reference: 'Galatians 3:13' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Life.', reference: 'John 14:6' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Mighty God.', reference: 'Isaiah 9:6' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Lamb of God.', reference: 'John 1:29' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the True God.', reference: '1 John 5:20' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Light in the Darkness.', reference: 'John 1:4–5' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Way to Heaven.', reference: 'John 14:2–6' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Miracle Worker.', reference: 'John 20:30–31' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Prince of Peace.', reference: 'Isaiah 9:6' },
  { text: "Jesus is the Commander of the Lord's Army.", reference: 'Joshua 5:13–15' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Savior.', reference: 'Luke 2:11' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Master.', reference: 'Luke 5:5' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Good Shepherd.', reference: 'John 10:11' },
  { text: 'Jesus is the Teacher.', reference: 'John 13:13' },
  { text: 'Jesus is Everything.', reference: 'Colossians 3:11' },
];
---
<Site title="About God" description="Explore what the Bible says about God’s love, grace, and nearness.">
  <section class="page-intro page-intro-compact"><div class="wrap">
    <h1>About God</h1>
    <p class="lead">Explore what Scripture says about who God is and how we can draw near to him.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="wrap section reading">
    <h2>God loves us</h2>
    <p>John 3:16 tells us that God loved the world and gave his Son, Jesus Christ, so that those who believe in him may have eternal life.</p>
    <h2>God gives grace</h2>
    <p>Ephesians 2:8–9 describes salvation as God’s gift, received through faith.</p>
    <h2>God invites us to draw near</h2>
    <p>Hebrews 4:14–16 points to Jesus as our high priest and invites us to approach God with confidence, trusting that we will find mercy and grace.</p>
    <h2>Who Jesus is</h2>
    <p>The Scripture references below link to the New King James Version (NKJV).</p>
    <ul>
      {statements.map(({ text, reference }) => (
        <li>
          {text}{' '}
          <a href={`https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=${encodeURIComponent(reference.replace('–', '-'))}&version=NKJV`}>
            {reference}
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p>Some Christians understand the commander who appears to Joshua as Christ appearing before his birth.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/praise/">Spend a moment in praise</a>
  </section>
</Site>
